er, uniform, one, the, a, that, each, from, than, which}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;-----------------------------------------------------------&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Sensation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;∪ Volition&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;{sensation, feeling} ∪ {will, volition, intention}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;-----------------------------------------------------------&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Phenomena&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;{is, not, exist, real, occur, happen, what, thing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;, nothing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;, phenomenon&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#E6E6E6;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=1;treeFolding=0;expand=1;" vertex="1" parent="jIT7mPLLUSJobsST0USL-36">
