        <UserObject label="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Logical systems organize information such that causes lead to effects.&lt;/span&gt;" link="data:page/id,UETkfCh4AJosU-Qw8zd5" id="W3f5UINCB4utkoovJ-PE-16">
