        <mxCell id="ASmkYjK9ElLdtuN8Vt9n-36" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;How do phenomena distinctly occur?&lt;/b&gt; Associations can be made between distinct phenomena.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;==================================&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Association&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;association, relation, like, with, similar, group, together, and, or&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;-----------------------------------------------------------&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Distinction&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;{distinct, different, separate, other, uniform, one, the, a, that, each, from, than, which}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;-----------------------------------------------------------&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Sensation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;∪ Volition&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;{sensation, feeling}&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;∪&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;{will, volition, intention}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;-----------------------------------------------------------&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&