        <mxCell id="ASmkYjK9ElLdtuN8Vt9n-67" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;How do phenomena associatively occur?&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;Sensations do not always occur with volition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;==================================&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Volition occurs without sensations.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;{}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;-----------------------------------------------------------&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Association&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;association&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;, relation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;, like, with, similar, group, together, and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;, or&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;-----------------------------------------------------------&lt;/font&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Distinction&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;{distinct, different, separate, other, unifor