        <mxCell id="ASmkYjK9ElLdtuN8Vt9n-194" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;How can events transition from &quot;not-occurring&quot; to &quot;occurring&quot;?&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;Events that occur from will are labelled as initiated.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;==================================&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Perception&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;{perception, observation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;-----------------------------------------------------------&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Event&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;{event}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;-----------------------------------------------------------&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Start and End ∪&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Sequence ∪&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 11px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Possession&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;{start, end, between, transition, period, from, to}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11p