        <mxCell id="uHxNGxETZ01MsBiVxSH5-65" value="phenomenological limits expose ontological structure&lt;br&gt;we can&#39;t see structure, yet we know it&lt;br&gt;the more structure we know, the more limited possible ontology can be&lt;br&gt;the capacity for ontology [extensions] are limited by structural knowledge" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="mExRIxhNE1BHIPu0LiUs-1">
