        <UserObject label="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;We exist.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;There is a &quot;what&quot; to whom the sensations occur - an &lt;i&gt;experiencer&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;of sensations. If sensations occur, and &quot;not existing&quot; necessarily requires sensations to never occur, then we must exist.&lt;/font&gt;" link="data:page/id,iVco3wyrZyf0eAhEmiHv" id="hU9yVLdhYgLbUcQZa_KH-4">
