        <mxCell id="FJX189DDfgS289pbAnCB-2" value="&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Objections&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(171, 171, 171)); background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;1.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(77, 77, 77));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(77, 77, 77));&quot;&gt;Perceived existence could be an illusion - &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;maybe I’m a brain in a jar&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; and wouldn&#39;t tell the difference&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(77, 77, 77));&quot;&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 25px; padding-right: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#330000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;This node does not specify how or where we exist; being &quot;just a brain in a jar&quot; (or in a simulation) still means that we exist in some form. An illusion still requires a subject who is having the illusion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#330000&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;2.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;The mind is susceptible to mistakes, therefore we can&#39;t fully trust&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; anything it concludes - including its own existence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 25px; padding-right: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#330000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Denying our own existence is itself a thought process (&quot;I doubt my existence&quot;). That thought process is a mental sensation, presupposing a mind. If there is no &quot;you&quot;, yet you feel all these sensations, then who is performing this doubt? This argument is self-defeating, invalidating its validity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(171, 171, 171)); background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;3.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(171, 171, 171)); background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4d4d4d&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;What about brain-dead individuals who can’t feel anything?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 25px; padding-right: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#330000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;This node addresses only the first-person proof of “If &lt;i&gt;I&lt;/i&gt; sense, &lt;i&gt;I&lt;/i&gt; exist.” Someone who cannot sense &lt;i&gt;anything&lt;/i&gt; is in no position to deny or confirm their existence via this argument. It doesn’t mean they do not exist; it only means &lt;b&gt;this&lt;/b&gt; argument (based on “I sense, therefore I exist”) is specifically about verifying one’s own existence for oneself.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=process;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#f5f5f5;gradientColor=#b3b3b3;strokeColor=#666666;verticalAlign=top;size=0.043478260869565216;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-200" y="270" width="400" height="280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="FJX189DDfgS289pbAnCB-3" style="edgeStyle=elbowEdgeStyle;shape=connector;curved=0;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;elbow=vertical;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=default;strokeWidth=2;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;endArrow=classic;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" parent="1" source="hU9yVLdhYgLbUcQZa_KH-4" target="2BuEYOIaSDZG7uk9uu39-1" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="740" y="410" as="sourcePoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="q161BaAn_xV_oLcZQyov-8" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;b&gt;I feel, therefore I am&lt;/b&gt;&quot;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 20px; margin-left: 0px; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&quot;I think, therefore I am&quot; is a subset of &quot;I feel, therefore I am&quot; because the experience of thinking is a mental sensation&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;Our existence isn&#39;t the primary axiom, but rather the experience of sensations.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;This node does not prove any&lt;font&gt; existence&lt;/font&gt; besides one&#39;s own existence&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;The node is premised on the occurance of sensations, which can only be experienced for oneself.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;As we can&#39;t experience the se&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;ns&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;ations that others do, this node isn&#39;t enough to prove that other &quot;ones&quot; exist.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;Sensory input is independent of intelligence, thus the intellect is not capable of proving existence - except only to be aware of the proof of sensory input.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;The only valid way to disprove one&#39;s existence is to prove that sensual/experiential sensations do not occur&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4d4d4d&quot;&gt;Sensory input is independent of intelligence, thus reason alone is not capable of proving existence - except only to be aware of sensory input and to assess its implications&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;It is impossible to make a sound argument against one&#39;s own existence, for the very act of disproving requires thought and contemplation - thus requiring one&#39;s existence to perform.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;Even if you mistrust rationality, experiencing anything (pain, hunger, thought, etc.) directly demonstrates some entity (&quot;you&quot;) exists.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;This node is true so long as these sensations occur (for one cannot verify their own existence [or non-existence] if they can&#39;t sense, feel, or think anything)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;S&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;ensory input is a proof of existence: no agent can rationally doubt their own existence while they experience thoughts, pleasure, pain, or some other sensation (for if they didn&#39;t exist, then they wouldn&#39;t feel anything to begin with)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=left;fillColor=#e6d0de;gradientColor=#d5739d;strokeColor=#996185;gradientDirection=north;verticalAlign=top;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="310" y="690" width="550" height="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;We experience an external reality.&lt;/font&gt;" link="data:page/id,BJJeBhxEE8Z-n9mm-ttt" id="KEaA8QlwYA8fVl5fipI4-1">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;gradientColor=#97d077;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="470" y="520" width="230" height="50" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="" link="data:page/id,likM1HnRl3nmRLB4e34p" id="34vBMR1qd-Jf7lbTVX3Z-1">
          <mxCell style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="410" y="105" width="350" height="25" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="2BuEYOIaSDZG7uk9uu39-1" value="&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Proofs by Contradiction&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(77, 77, 77));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;1.&lt;/b&gt; Assume: we do not exist.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;2.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;We would not experience any sensation whatsoever (by definition:&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; there is no &quot;us&quot;).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3.&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;From this node&#39;s pr&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(77, 77, 77));&quot;&gt;emises, we accept that that sensations do occur.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(77, 77, 77)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;4.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(77, 77, 77));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Contradiction: to validly deny our own existence, we must accept&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; that sensations do not occur &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(133, 106, 106), rgb(133, 106, 106));&quot;&gt;(Step 2)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(77, 77, 77));&quot;&gt; - yet they do occur &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(133, 106, 106), rgb(133, 106, 106));&quot;&gt;(Step 3).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#330000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;You can’t deny your own existence without thinking about it - and that very thought is proof you exist. If no &#39;you&#39; existed at all, there’d be no mind to doubt anything. So the act of doubting or sensing something already confirms there’s an experiencer: you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=process;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#f5f5f5;gradientColor=#b3b3b3;strokeColor=#666666;verticalAlign=top;size=0.043478260869565216;gradientDirection=north;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="970" y="325" width="380" height="170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram name="EaR2" id="nwnlQaXgrGs-5OhVyxBg">
    <mxGraphModel dx="3237" dy="1369" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1169" pageHeight="1654" background="#808080" math="0" shadow="1" adaptiveColors="none">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="xCnwdoKPpG8b0vwkaMOA-0" />
        <mxCell id="xCnwdoKPpG8b0vwkaMOA-1" parent="xCnwdoKPpG8b0vwkaMOA-0" />
        <UserObject label="&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 32px;&quot;&gt;How Objective Truths Lead to Islam Through Reason&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);&quot;&gt;Proving Existence (Node 2)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" link="data:page/id,q1TZ7uQ2KXKU_8ORelwv" id="xCnwdoKPpG8b0vwkaMOA-2">
          <mxCell style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e6d0de;strokeColor=#996185;gradientColor=#d5739d;fontSize=1;" parent="xCnwdoKPpG8b0vwkaMOA-1" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="80" y="40" width="1010" height="110" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;An external reality exists.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;If sensations occur, and an external world &quot;not existing&quot;&amp;nbsp;necessarily requires sensations to never occur, then an external world must exist.&lt;/font&gt;" link="data:page/id,iVco3wyrZyf0eAhEmiHv" id="xCnwdoKPpG8b0vwkaMOA-3">
          <mxCell style="shape=hexagon;perimeter=hexagonPerimeter2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fixedSize=1;size=30;fillColor=#b0e3e6;strokeColor=#0e8088;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=2;spacing=16;" parent="xCnwdoKPpG8b0vwkaMOA-1" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="430" y="360" width="310" height="100" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
