        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="xCnwdoKPpG8b0vwkaMOA-11" value="&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Objections&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;1.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;All stimuli could be simulated in a brain-in-a-jar scenario&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 25px; padding-right: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#330000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;This node doesn’t claim anything about how that external reality is constituted. Even if you’re a brain in a jar, there’s still a jar, some fluid, a machine, something beyond your conscious mind. That is &lt;i&gt;your &lt;/i&gt;&quot;external reality&quot;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background-color: transparent; padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;2.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Reality&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4d4d4d&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;might be an illusion or a dream.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 25px; padding-right: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#330000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Illusions, dreams, and hallucinations still have a cause external to your present, waking consciousness. An illusion is not the same as &quot;no reality.&quot; It just means your mind’s representation is inaccurate relative to some external cause.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;3.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;What if my mind is the only thing that exists (so no brain and no jar), simulating&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; everything internally on its own?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 25px; padding-right: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(51, 0, 0), rgb(51, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;a.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;If your mind simulates everything, then that simulated construct functions like an &quot;external world&quot; relative to your conscious perspective. You’re effectively partitioning your mind into &quot;the part that orchestrates the simulation&quot; vs. &quot;the conscious self.&quot; The hidden &quot;simulation engine&quot; is external to your conscious control.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(51, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;b.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(51, 0, 0), rgb(51, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt; If the simulation is somehow metaphysically equivalent to your mind itself, then it would&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(51, 0, 0), rgb(51, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;have to exist outside of time and space (which would be simulated&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(51, 0, 0), rgb(51, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;constructs within your mind) and would need to be free from need and necessity (for there is&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(51, 0, 0), rgb(51, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;no external world to gain sustenance from and to be dependent on).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;i.&lt;/b&gt; If you have free will and are unable to transcend space and time, then space&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; and time are external to your conscious will (in some form) and thus an&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; external world must exists.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;ii.&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 0, 0); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;If you do not have free will, then your mind is a result of some deterministic&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; process, necessitating the existence of an external structure or cause (within&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; time and space, or some other law).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=process;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#f5f5f5;gradientColor=#b3b3b3;strokeColor=#666666;verticalAlign=top;size=0.043478260869565216;" parent="xCnwdoKPpG8b0vwkaMOA-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-280" y="230" width="480" height="360" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="xCnwdoKPpG8b0vwkaMOA-12" style="edgeStyle=elbowEdgeStyle;shape=connector;curved=0;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;elbow=vertical;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=default;strokeWidth=2;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;endArrow=classic;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" parent="xCnwdoKPpG8b0vwkaMOA-1" source="xCnwdoKPpG8b0vwkaMOA-3" target="oZeFloPE9jX_Hjch5scy-0" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="740" y="410" as="sourcePoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="xCnwdoKPpG8b0vwkaMOA-15" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 11px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Any objection to this node requires ad hoc explanations that violate Occam’s Razor, reducing to one of two extreme positions:&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;Only the self exists, which begs the question of how the self came into existence in the first place&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;Nothing exists at all - including the self - which requires sensations to&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;not&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;occur, thus invalidating this node&#39;s premises (this is already addressed in the &quot;we exist&quot; node).&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;If one claims that only the self exists, they must explain why the self alone exists without an external reality. But interestingly, this mirrors the same argument theists use for God&#39;s existence, which such skeptics often dismiss as irrational:&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;Just like God, the &quot;self&quot; in this scenario would exist outside of time and space, would be capable of generating complex realities ex nihilo (from absolute nothingness), and would be would be self-sustaining and independent of any external cause.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;As such, if skeptics want to reject God on the grounds that such an entity is &quot;unjustified&quot; or &quot;too extraordinary,&quot; then they must also reject the idea that their own isolated self is the sole existence (since it requires the exact same extraordinary assumptions)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;This node is true so long as these sensations occur (one cannot verify the existence [or non-existence] of an external world if they can&#39;t sense, feel, or think anything)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=left;fillColor=#e6d0de;gradientColor=#d5739d;strokeColor=#996185;gradientDirection=north;verticalAlign=top;" parent="xCnwdoKPpG8b0vwkaMOA-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="340" y="620" width="490" height="270" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Hpf_-bkSC1mbr_i7II5m-0" style="edgeStyle=elbowEdgeStyle;shape=connector;curved=0;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;elbow=vertical;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=default;strokeWidth=2;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;endArrow=classic;" parent="xCnwdoKPpG8b0vwkaMOA-1" target="Hpf_-bkSC1mbr_i7II5m-1" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="585" y="460" as="sourcePoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;We experience an external reality.&lt;/font&gt;" link="data:page/id,BJJeBhxEE8Z-n9mm-ttt" id="Hpf_-bkSC1mbr_i7II5m-1">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;gradientColor=#97d077;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=1;" parent="xCnwdoKPpG8b0vwkaMOA-1" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="470" y="520" width="230" height="50" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="" link="data:page/id,likM1HnRl3nmRLB4e34p" id="px4XCnrzFBr16EN9mvN5-0">
          <mxCell style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" parent="xCnwdoKPpG8b0vwkaMOA-1" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="410" y="105" width="350" height="25" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="oZeFloPE9jX_Hjch5scy-0" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Proofs by Contradiction&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(77, 77, 77));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;1.&lt;/b&gt; Assume: an external reality does not exist.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;2.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Nothing external could cause the sensations we feel (by definition).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;3.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;From this node&#39;s pr&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;emises, we accept that sensations do occur.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;4.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;If we feel sensations (Step 3) yet no external reality causes them (Step 2), then they must be caused internally (whatever &quot;we&quot; &lt;i&gt;are&lt;/i&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;5.&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;If sensations are caused internally (Step 4), then &quot;we&quot; both experience and generate these sensations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(77, 77, 77));&quot;&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px; margin-right: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Case A.&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;We have free will.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(171, 171, 171)); font-size: 11px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;6a.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(171, 171, 171)); font-size: 11px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4d4d4d&quot;&gt;If we can will our sensations into existence (because “we” are the only possible&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; cause), then we be capable of causing all sensations at will - never experiencing any&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; unwelcome or surprising sensation.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px; margin-left: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(77, 77, 77)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;7a.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 1px; font-weight: 400; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(77, 77, 77));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Contradiction: to validly deny the existence of an external reality, we must accept&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(77, 77, 77)); font-weight: 400; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;that we&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;are&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;reality &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-weight: 400; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(133, 106, 106), rgb(133, 106, 106));&quot;&gt;(Step 5)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(77, 77, 77)); font-weight: 400; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt; and that we are capable of causing any sensation at&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; will&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(133, 106, 106), rgb(133, 106, 106)); font-weight: 400; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;(Step 6a)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(77, 77, 77)); font-weight: 400; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- yet this does not occur, especially considering the existence of&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; unwanted sensations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-weight: 400; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(133, 106, 106), rgb(133, 106, 106));&quot;&gt;(Step 3).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Case B.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;We do not have free will.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(171, 171, 171)); padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px; margin-left: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;6b.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;If we do not have free will, then whatever &quot;we&quot; &lt;i&gt;are&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;is the result of some internal&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; deterministic process that causes our sensations - something beyond our control.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px; margin-left: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(77, 77, 77)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;7b.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(77, 77, 77));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Contradiction: to validly deny the existence of an external reality, we must accept&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(77, 77, 77));&quot;&gt;that we &lt;i&gt;are&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;all there is&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(133, 106, 106), rgb(133, 106, 106));&quot;&gt;(Step 5)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(77, 77, 77));&quot;&gt; - yet some distinct causal system&amp;nbsp;that isn&#39;t &quot;&lt;i&gt;us&lt;/i&gt;&quot;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; causes our sensations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(133, 106, 106), rgb(133, 106, 106));&quot;&gt;(Step 6b).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#330000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;If you try to say &quot;Nothing outside me exists at all,&quot; where do unwanted or surprising sensations come from? If you really had total conscious control, you’d never experience anything you didn’t choose - yet we feel unexpected hunger, fear, and dreams. That means these sensations come from outside our direct self. We call that &quot;external reality.&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=process;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#f5f5f5;gradientColor=#b3b3b3;strokeColor=#666666;verticalAlign=top;size=0.043478260869565216;gradientDirection=north;align=left;" parent="xCnwdoKPpG8b0vwkaMOA-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="970" y="220" width="500" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram name="EaR3" id="BJJeBhxEE8Z-n9mm-ttt">
    <mxGraphModel dx="3237" dy="1369" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1169" pageHeight="1654" background="#808080" math="0" shadow="1" adaptiveColors="none">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="VyjisshgyECK9-Sqm5kk-0" />
        <mxCell id="VyjisshgyECK9-Sqm5kk-1" parent="VyjisshgyECK9-Sqm5kk-0" />
        <UserObject label="&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 32px;&quot;&gt;How Objective Truths Lead to Islam Through Reason&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);&quot;&gt;Proving Existence (Node 3)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" link="data:page/id,q1TZ7uQ2KXKU_8ORelwv" id="VyjisshgyECK9-Sqm5kk-2">
          <mxCell style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e6d0de;strokeColor=#996185;gradientColor=#d5739d;fontSize=1;" parent="VyjisshgyECK9-Sqm5kk-1" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="80" y="40" width="1010" height="110" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="ti0vvtZxl40ifqODchoW-2" style="edgeStyle=elbowEdgeStyle;shape=connector;curved=0;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;elbow=vertical;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=default;strokeWidth=2;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;endArrow=classic;" parent="VyjisshgyECK9-Sqm5kk-1" source="VyjisshgyECK9-Sqm5kk-3" target="ti0vvtZxl40ifqODchoW-0" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;We experience an external reality.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;We experience sensations that originate from an external reality, indicating that we are distinct from it (ie. whatever that external&amp;nbsp;reality is, it isn&#39;t &quot;us&quot;). This capacity to experience anything at all means that we are&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;conscious&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;" link="data:page/id,iVco3wyrZyf0eAhEmiHv" id="VyjisshgyECK9-Sqm5kk-3">
          <mxCell style="shape=hexagon;perimeter=hexagonPerimeter2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fixedSize=1;size=30;fillColor=#b0e3e6;strokeColor=#0e8088;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=2;spacing=16;spacingTop=1;" parent="VyjisshgyECK9-Sqm5kk-1" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="360" y="470" width="450" height="100" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="VyjisshgyECK9-Sqm5kk-4" style="edgeStyle=elbowEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;elbow=vertical;curved=0;strokeWidth=2;" parent="VyjisshgyECK9-Sqm5kk-1" source="VyjisshgyECK9-Sqm5kk-5" target="tBRKAKRQe_UZLHtQJRz1-0" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="582.5" y="405" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="585" y="470" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tBRKAKRQe_UZLHtQJRz1-6" style="edgeStyle=elbowEdgeStyle;shape=connector;curved=0;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;elbow=vertical;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=default;strokeWidth=2;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;endArrow=classic;" parent="VyjisshgyECK9-Sqm5kk-1" source="VyjisshgyECK9-Sqm5kk-5" target="tBRKAKRQe_UZLHtQJRz1-1" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Physical sensations occur.&lt;/font&gt;" link="data:page/id,YQBf6YmFWLRNtrCXEbi-" id="VyjisshgyECK9-Sqm5kk-5">
