        <mxCell id="T-k3KGYJa3-lr_2IG98H-0" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Proofs by Contradiction&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(77, 77, 77));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;1.&lt;/b&gt; Assume: we do not experience an external reality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px; margin-left: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Case A.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;We don&#39;t exist.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px; margin-left: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left: 20px; padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;2a.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;An external reality does exist, but our consciousness does not (by&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; definition).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left: 20px; padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;3a.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;From this node&#39;s premises, we accept that we do exist.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left: 20px; padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;4a.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 1px; font-weight: 400; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(77, 77, 77));&quot;&gt;Contradiction: to validly deny our experience of an external reality by our&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; own non-existence&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-weight: 400; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(133, 106, 106), rgb(133, 106, 106));&quot;&gt;(Step 1)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(77, 77, 77)); font-weight: 400; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;, we must exist&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(77, 77, 77)); font-weight: 400; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-weight: 400; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(133, 106, 106), rgb(133, 106, 106));&quot;&gt;(Step 3a).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left: 0px; padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px; margin-right: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px; margin-left: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Case B.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;An external reality does not exist.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px; margin-left: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left: 20px; padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;2b.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;We &lt;i&gt;are&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;reality, such that nothing exists externally (by definition).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left: 20px; padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;3b.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;From this node&#39;s premises, we accept that an external reality exists.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left: 20px; padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;4b.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 1px; font-weight: 400; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(77, 77, 77));&quot;&gt;Contradiction: to validly deny our experience of an external reality by&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; reality&#39;s non-existence&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-weight: 400; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(133, 106, 106), rgb(133, 106, 106));&quot;&gt;(Step 1)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(77, 77, 77)); font-weight: 400; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;, reality must exist&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(77, 77, 77)); font-weight: 400; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-weight: 400; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(133, 106, 106), rgb(133, 106, 106));&quot;&gt;(Step 3a).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#330000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;If you try to say &quot;Nothing outside me exists at all,&quot; where do unwanted or surprising sensations come from? If you really had total conscious control, you’d never experience anything you didn’t choose - yet we feel unexpected hunger, fear, and dreams. That means these sensations come from outside our direct self. We call that &quot;external reality.&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=process;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#f5f5f5;gradientColor=#b3b3b3;strokeColor=#666666;verticalAlign=top;size=0.043478260869565216;gradientDirection=north;align=left;" parent="VyjisshgyECK9-Sqm5kk-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="970" y="380" width="440" height="280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
