        <mxCell id="Gn5ei-XxtuQPZf2ZkEhh-15" value="&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Objections&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;1.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Reality could be an illusion, or our brains could be in a jar somewhere&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; with everything we experience being simulated by electrical signals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background-color: transparent; padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;2.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;What if my mind is the only thing that exists (so no brain and no jar -&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; a solipsistic &quot;god&quot;),&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;and it simulates all this on its own?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 25px; padding-right: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;These objections are addressed in the premises.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;3.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4d4d4d&quot;&gt;Senses can be deceived, so we can’t know anything for certain.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 25px; padding-right: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#330000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Imperfection or deception of senses doesn’t negate that we &lt;i&gt;have&lt;/i&gt; them and that &lt;i&gt;something&lt;/i&gt; is being experienced. This node only asserts that we receive inputs from outside ourselves; it does &lt;i&gt;not&lt;/i&gt; claim total reliability or perfect interpretation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=process;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#f5f5f5;gradientColor=#b3b3b3;strokeColor=#666666;verticalAlign=top;size=0.043478260869565216;" vertex="1" parent="Gn5ei-XxtuQPZf2ZkEhh-1">
          <mxGeometry x="-90" y="435" width="390" height="170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Gn5ei-XxtuQPZf2ZkEhh-16" style="edgeStyle=elbowEdgeStyle;shape=connector;curved=0;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;elbow=vertical;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=default;strokeWidth=2;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;endArrow=classic;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" edge="1" parent="Gn5ei-XxtuQPZf2ZkEhh-1" source="Gn5ei-XxtuQPZf2ZkEhh-4" target="Gn5ei-XxtuQPZf2ZkEhh-24">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="740" y="520" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="970" y="520" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Gn5ei-XxtuQPZf2ZkEhh-17" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;This node doesn’t say our senses perfectly mirror reality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 11px; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;It only says we do have sensory contact with whatever exists outside us.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;This node is true so long as both an external world and ourselves exist.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 11px; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(171, 171, 171)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;To experience any external reality is for it to transmit information that our senses recieve.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(171, 171, 171)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;More detailed obj&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(171, 171, 171));&quot;&gt;ecti&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(171, 171, 171)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;ons to this node are addressed in its premises.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4d4d4d&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=left;fillColor=#e6d0de;gradientColor=#d5739d;strokeColor=#996185;gradientDirection=north;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="Gn5ei-XxtuQPZf2ZkEhh-1">
          <mxGeometry x="380" y="760" width="410" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
