        <UserObject label="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;We have self-awareness.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;We label the information that &quot;we exist&quot; as &lt;i&gt;self-awareness&lt;/i&gt;, as it reduces to&amp;nbsp;an internal model of our own existence.&lt;/span&gt;" link="data:page/id,iVco3wyrZyf0eAhEmiHv" id="j4HVYzPnCFSpxK68TefG-4">
