        <mxCell id="j4HVYzPnCFSpxK68TefG-15" value="&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Objections&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;1.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Self-awareness could be an illusion - what if I only &lt;i&gt;appear&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;to have self-awareness?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 25px; padding-right: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;This node doen&#39;t explore the full complexity of self-reflection or meta-cognition but rather establishes that we are at least minimally aware of our own existence. If self-awareness were an illusion (meaning we are somehow being deceived into thinking we are self-aware), then one of the following must be true:&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;a.&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;We lack the capacity for logic or even basic recognition of our own senses&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; (like a baby or an inanimate object), contradicting the use of logic in this very&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; diagram (which requires at least a minimal ability to recognize distinctions,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; contradictions, and reason about experience). Otherwise, we could not&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; explore whether self-awareness is an illusion to begin with.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;b.&lt;/b&gt; We don&#39;t experience sensations at all, which contradicts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#330000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;the &quot;&lt;b&gt;we exist&lt;/b&gt;&quot;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; premise. And even if our senses were deceptive,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#330000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;this would not negate the&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; fundamental fact that we experience sensations to begin with - only that the&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; content of those sensations may be unreliable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=process;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#f5f5f5;gradientColor=#b3b3b3;strokeColor=#666666;verticalAlign=top;size=0.043478260869565216;" parent="j4HVYzPnCFSpxK68TefG-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-150" y="414" width="460" height="219" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="j4HVYzPnCFSpxK68TefG-16" style="edgeStyle=elbowEdgeStyle;shape=connector;curved=0;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;elbow=vertical;html=1;strokeColor=default;strokeWidth=2;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;endArrow=classic;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="j4HVYzPnCFSpxK68TefG-1" source="j4HVYzPnCFSpxK68TefG-4" target="7FM6qAeRniFPF41VSvX6-0" edge="1">
