        <mxCell id="nq-0T4J13hbT3Bw9exyo-0" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Proofs by Contradiction&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(51, 0, 0), rgb(51, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;This node is a definition, not a deduction - a label for something previously established to be true . As such, assuming this node to be false necessarily&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 0, 0); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(51, 0, 0), rgb(51, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;the premises are false.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(77, 77, 77));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;1.&lt;/b&gt; Assume: information does not exist.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;2.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Our experiences/sensations have no content (by definition).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;3.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;If our sensations have no content &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(133, 106, 106), rgb(133, 106, 106));&quot;&gt;(Step 2)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;, then our experiences are empty, having no&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &quot;what&quot; (ie. those sensations are not real and effectively don&#39;t exist).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;4.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;From this node&#39;s premises, we accept that our experiences exist.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;5.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Contradiction: to deny &quot;information&quot; as a valid definition, we must accept that our&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; sensations don&#39;t exist &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(133, 106, 106), rgb(133, 106, 106));&quot;&gt;(Step 3)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt; - yet they exist &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(133, 106, 106), rgb(133, 106, 106));&quot;&gt;(Step 4)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#330000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;If &quot;information&quot; doesn’t exist, what exactly are we experiencing from the outside world? Whether we call it data, signals, or something else, there’s &lt;i&gt;something&lt;/i&gt; flowing from &quot;out there&quot; into our awareness. That’s what we mean by &quot;information.&quot; So to say there’s no information is basically to say we experience nothing at all - which contradicts the fact that we do experience things.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=process;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#f5f5f5;gradientColor=#b3b3b3;strokeColor=#666666;verticalAlign=top;size=0.043478260869565216;gradientDirection=north;align=left;" parent="D02OvW6ERCM4YyDwM5Ql-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="930" y="405" width="480" height="250" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
