        <mxCell id="RRrBzv9HIXfb1x-VWBYH-0" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 11px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;This node does not explore the nature of those external sources (ie.&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;what&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;they are)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(171, 171, 171)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Information could be perfectly preserved or be corrupted or faulty, or come from a deterministic source or a non-deterministic one, or even a random source or a willful one&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(171, 171, 171)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;This node &lt;b&gt;only &lt;/b&gt;excludes absolute nothingness as a source of information&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4d4d4d&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=left;fillColor=#e6d0de;gradientColor=#d5739d;strokeColor=#996185;gradientDirection=north;verticalAlign=top;" parent="N5PPzdv7nw5bOdpd8VeD-1" vertex="1">
