        <mxCell id="4UcTOpRsG9XILVAxGTJq-0" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Proofs by Contradiction&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(77, 77, 77));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;1.&lt;/b&gt; Assume: information does not require a source.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;2.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Information (the content of our experiences) could arise entirely disconnected from&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; anything that exists (by definition: ie. from absolute nothingness).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;3.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;From this node&#39;s pr&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;emises, we accept that reality exists and is external to our&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; consciousness, whereas information is internal to it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;4.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Contradiction: to validly deny that information requires a source, we must accept&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; that nothing external to us exists &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(133, 106, 106), rgb(133, 106, 106));&quot;&gt;(Step 2)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt; - yet reality exists &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(133, 106, 106), rgb(133, 106, 106));&quot;&gt;(Step 3).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#330000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;If you say a piece of information doesn’t come from anything, you’re implying it’s literally produced by emptiness—no reality, no external cause. But we know we interact with some external world; even random or unknown phenomena qualify as a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(51, 0, 0), rgb(255, 218, 218)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&quot;source.&quot; If there was pure nothingness, we wouldn&#39;t experience anything to begin with.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=process;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#f5f5f5;gradientColor=#b3b3b3;strokeColor=#666666;verticalAlign=top;size=0.043478260869565216;gradientDirection=north;align=left;" parent="N5PPzdv7nw5bOdpd8VeD-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="970" y="400" width="460" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
