        <UserObject label="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Understanding is an internal model of reality.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;We label the way different pieces of information are internally organized (forming a model of the external world) as our &lt;i&gt;understanding&lt;/i&gt;. The more closely this model aligns with reality, the more accurate our understanding becomes.&lt;/span&gt;" link="data:page/id,VuEyJK-5QdxOhdqgMgJb" id="djvg--Fz5CP-9a9F3K58-6">
