          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="vuLEA_X3Z8HaORrOFKFY-0" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;This node does not claim that human beings are&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;always&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;logical (in the sense that only true statements are said)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 11px; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;It only implies that&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;any&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;logical system that denies the existence of logic to begin with cannot be sound, as&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(171, 171, 171)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;any&lt;/i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(171, 171, 171)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;attempt to reason away logic still requires logic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font&gt;Future nodes will explore the concepts of truth and falsehood&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;This node functions the same way as&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Gödel’s self‐referential statements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;I&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;f this node were false, then none of its premises could even form a meaningful definition (contradicting the axioms that we feel senations, which are established to be true without the use of reason).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(77, 77, 77));&quot;&gt;If this node is true, then the definition will hold up and be consistent with the rest of the system.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4d4d4d&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=left;fillColor=#e6d0de;gradientColor=#d5739d;strokeColor=#996185;gradientDirection=north;verticalAlign=top;" parent="VRDFq0wFc6pFJHJ383-H-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="370" y="740" width="430" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
