        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="OgN7uMYAacG9BayYqLVh-0" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Proofs by Contradiction&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(51, 0, 0), rgb(51, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;This node is a definition, not a deduction - a label for something previously established to be true. As such, assuming this node to be false necessarily requires the premises are false.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(77, 77, 77));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;1.&lt;/b&gt; Assume: knowledge cannot be true or false.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;2.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;No comparison can be made between reality and our understanding (by definition: the&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; accuracy of one&#39;s understanding has no valid meaning).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px; padding-bottom: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;3.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;If the accuracy of one&#39;s understanding has no valid meaning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(133, 106, 106), rgb(133, 106, 106));&quot;&gt;(Step 2)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;, then any true&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; statement would be equally meaningful/meaningless as any false statement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px; padding-bottom: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4.&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;I&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;f all claims are equally meaningful/meaningless in principle&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(133, 106, 106), rgb(133, 106, 106));&quot;&gt;(Step 3)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;, then this node - as&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; well as all its premises - are equal in value as their opposites (ex. &quot;we exist&quot; and &quot;we&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(77, 77, 77), rgb(171, 171, 171)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;don&#39;t exist&quot;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px; padding-bottom: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;5.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;If this node is equal as its opposite&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(133, 106, 106), rgb(133, 106, 106));&quot;&gt;(Step 4)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;, then &quot;knowledge can be true or false&quot; is&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; equally valid as &quot;knowledge can&#39;t be true or false&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px; padding-bottom: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;6.&lt;/b&gt; If&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&quot;knowledge can be true or false&quot; is just as valid as&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-size: 11px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&quot;knowledge can&#39;t be true or false&quot;,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; then this node must be false (ie. it is false that truth and falsehood have distinct value).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; margin-bottom: 4px; padding-bottom: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;7.&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;Contradiction: to deny the concepts of truth and falsehood&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(133, 106, 106), rgb(133, 106, 106));&quot;&gt;(Step 1)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;, we will not only&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; accept contradictions as valid &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(133, 106, 106), rgb(133, 106, 106));&quot;&gt;(Steps 4 &amp;amp; 5)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;, we also must accept that falsehood is a&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; valid concept&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(133, 106, 106), rgb(133, 106, 106));&quot;&gt;(Step 6)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#330000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;If we say that knowledge can’t be true or false, then we’re basically saying it doesn’t matter whether our ideas match reality or not. But i&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 0, 0), rgb(255, 218, 218)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;f we pretend there’s no such thing as truth or falsehood, then we’d have to treat every belief - even the completely wrong ones - as equally meaningful. But the moment we do that, we’ve already admitted that false beliefs are possible, because we’re trying to say this belief itself is wrong. That means we’re still relying on truth and falsehood, even while denying them. So the idea that &quot;knowledge can’t be true or false&quot; just falls&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 0, 0); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 0, 0), rgb(255, 218, 218)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;apart.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=process;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#f5f5f5;gradientColor=#b3b3b3;strokeColor=#666666;verticalAlign=top;size=0.043478260869565216;gradientDirection=north;align=left;" parent="squETe9dAdE64J5XPLQU-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="900" y="305" width="490" height="390" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
