        <mxCell id="0CvlbLKx0ee9BSFNSc6A-1" value="&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 25px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;consciousness is not sensations&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;there are concepts thare are objectively true&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 25px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;this requires logic to exist&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;logic to model the world is sound&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;information exists&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;axioms and premises&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;knowledge of something is not the thing itself&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 30px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;the only way to know something 100% is to sense it&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;not exactly, can be wrong... has to be worded better&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;" parent="1" vertex="1">
