        <mxCell id="7jwuDECKpDgqieylm1P--283" value="A &lt;b&gt;system &lt;/b&gt;is a set of axioms and theorems that seeks to deductively explain reality" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" parent="1" vertex="1">
